  "short_description": "<p>Elegant coaster made of natural rattan and ceramic – heat-resistant and handcrafted in Vietnam for sustainable wholesale supply.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"619\">This <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"319\">rattan ceramic coaster</strong> is a refined blend of natural handwoven rattan and durable ceramic, handcrafted in Vietnam. The outer rattan ring is tightly woven by skilled artisans, offering a warm, organic touch, while the ceramic center provides a smooth, heat-resistant surface that protects tables from hot or cold beverages.</p>\n<p data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"822\">Elegant, functional, and sustainable, these coasters are perfect for cafés, restaurants, hotels, or home use. Available in various patterns and sizes, they serve both decorative and practical purposes.</p>\n<p data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"964\"><strong data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"855\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> offers <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"874\">OEM/ODM</strong> services, custom branding, and wholesale supply to global importers and lifestyle brands.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"993\">✅ <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"993\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1307\">\n<li data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1039\">\n<p data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1039\">Combination of ceramic and natural rattan</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1096\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1096\">Heat-resistant, moisture-absorbing, and scratch-free</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1143\">\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1143\">Handwoven frame with sturdy ceramic center</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1198\">\n<p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1198\">Customizable logo, size, colors, or gift packaging</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1256\">\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1256\">Ideal for home, office, restaurants, cafes, or hotels</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1307\">\n<p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1307\">Eco-friendly, biodegradable, and made in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1312\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1341\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1339\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1365\">Every coaster supports:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1667\">\n<li data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1412\">\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1412\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1410\">Local Vietnamese artisans and farmers</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1477\">\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1477\"><strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1454\">Full use of local natural materials</strong> – ceramic and rattan</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1547\"><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1504\">Export-driven income</strong> for Vietnam’s traditional craft industry</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1612\">\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1612\"><strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1592\">Plastic-free, sustainable alternatives</strong> for global buyers</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1667\">\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1667\"><strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1640\">Cultural preservation</strong> through handcrafted design</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1801\">As a <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1730\">manufacturer, factory, and global wholesale exporter</strong>, Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd delivers both quality and cultural value.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1806\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1842\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1840\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1934\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1876\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1879\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1934\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
